# =============================================================================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.history/

# =============================================================================
# OS
# =============================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# =============================================================================
# Generated pipeline artifacts
# Draft media (imagen output) is regenerated by demo/ runs — not source.
# =============================================================================
drafts/media/

# =============================================================================
# Submission drafts — local working docs, not part of the codebase.
# =============================================================================
docs/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
docs/DEVPOST.md

# =============================================================================
# Web frontend — TEMPORARILY excluded until final submission.
# Everything goes public eventually; web/ is the deliberate last-moment check-in.
# Repo root IS the project, so the path is `web/` (not `agentic-marketing/web`).
#
# ⚠️ AT SUBMISSION — to include the UI:
#      1. DELETE the `web/` line below.
#      2. git add web/ .gitignore && git commit -m "Add web UI" && git push
#    A plain `git add web/` is SILENTLY IGNORED while the line below exists —
#    do step 1 first, or you'll push an incomplete repo without noticing.
#
# (web/ is currently tracked; see notes below if you start a fresh-history repo.)
# =============================================================================
web/
